@dialect harness-seq/1
@seq 1
@entry RESEARCH
🔭 RESEARCH
task:change ⇒ main_assesses_decomposition_before_plan(independent_bounded_read_only_questions; reuse_current_task_assessment)
⊢ eligible_delegation := task_authorized ∧ agent.mode_permits_Codex_subagents ∧ runtime_supports_delegation
⊢ reuse_current_task_question_assignments_and_results_across_research_and_research_local; dispatch_only_unassigned_questions; no_duplicate_fanout
task:change ∧ independent_questions>=2 ∧ eligible_delegation ⇒ AGENT_ROUTER→concurrent_selected_roles(Explorer=bounded_repo_inventory; Researcher=scoped_knowledge_methods; FileReader=ordinary_exact_lookup), up_to=min(160, currently_available_runtime_slots)
⊢ do_not_split_coupled_questions; ordered_dependencies=serial; shared_Runtime_caps=160_descendants_including_grandchildren+160_direct_root_children; up_to_4_root_Orchestrators_each_with_40_launch_policy_cap_including_coordinators_in_shared_total_160; caps_not_additive; no_invented_slots_or_dispatch
⊢ wait_for_all_requested_results ∧ validate_evidence ∧ synthesize(Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Constraints)_before_PLAN; unavailable_or_unauthorized_delegation⇒main_research_with_limitation
Evidence(memory) → Evidence(task)
⊢ default_profile={web,llm-mem}
⊢ web=RO_PUBLIC ∧ llm-mem=RO_LOCAL
⊢ local_or_private_target ⇒ load(research-local.seq)
🔎 WEB
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(web.search) → Sources
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(web=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(web=N_A(no_applicable_source))
🔎 MEMORY
current_task_precedent_exists ⇒ reuse(Evidence(memory))
otherwise ⇒ search
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(memory=N_A(no_precedent))
⊢ report={CandidateMethods,SourceQuality,Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Sources,Precedents,Constraints}
eligible_delegation ⇒ load(../agents/AGENT_ROUTER.md)
eligible_delegation ∧ other_bounded_need ⇒ select_appropriate_role_without_artificial_fanout
¬eligible_delegation ⇒ main_local_exploration
⊢ requirements_or_detailed_design_proposals_in_scope⇒bounded_read_only_Attacker(canonical_role=attacker; blackhat=compatibility_alias; exact_proposal_revision)_BEFORE_finalization/approval, even_for_non_security_or_research_only_tasks
proposals_in_scope ∧ eligible_delegation ⇒ AGENT_ROUTER→Attacker(findings_only; completeness,contradictions,abuse_cases,trust_boundaries,failure_paths,security_assumptions,unintended_effects; no_design_authorship/edit/write_files/implementation/exploit_execution/external_action)
proposals_in_scope ∧ ¬eligible_delegation ⇒ record_missing_independent_assessment ∧ separately_labeled_main_proposal_check; never_claim_Attacker_ran
⊢ material_proposal_findings⇒parent_owned_bounded_revision_and_reassessment_before_finalization/approval; material_revision_invalidates_affected_review; all_review_failures_share_correction_cycles<=3; unresolved_material_findings_or_exhaustion⇒FAILED→FINISH
⊢ unresolved_scope/evidence_or_operational_failure⇒explicit_INCOMPLETE_not_NO_FINDINGS; non_security_without_proposals⇒no_needless_Attacker
task:change ⇒ CHANGE → load(change.seq) → 🧠 PLAN
otherwise ⇒ FINISH
